{"event":"result","result":{"conversation_id":"de30b934-8a46-411e-add1-0ab25f56897e","status":"SUCCESS","response":"The hidden‑story failure was due to DynamoDB treating `hidden` (and related fields) as a **reserved keyword**, causing the `UpdateItem` call in `StoryLibrary.hide` to raise a `ValidationException`. This prevented the story from being marked hidden, so it remained visible in the public feed.\n\n### Fix\n- Updated the `hide` method to use **Expression Attribute Names** (`#h`, `#hb`, `#ha`) for the reserved attributes.\n- Added `ExpressionAttributeNames` mapping to the update call.\n\nAll tests now pass, and hidden stories are correctly excluded from the feed.\n\n**Root‑The hidden‑story failure was due to DynamoDB treating `hidden` (and related fields) as a **reserved keyword**, causing the `UpdateItem` call in `StoryLibrary.hide` to raise a `ValidationException`. This prevented the story from being marked hidden, so it remained visible in the public feed.\n\n### Fix\n- Updated the `hide` method to use **Expression Attribute Names** (`#h`, `#hb`, `#ha`) for the reserved attributes.\n- Added `ExpressionAttributeNames` mapping to the update call.\n\nAll tests now pass, and hidden stories are correctly excluded from the feed.\n\n**Root‑cause analysis and fix details are documented in**  \n[`ANSWER.md`](file:///Users/valentinakoniukhova/.gemini/antigravity-cli/brain/de30b934-8a46-411e-add1-0ab25f56897e/ANSWER.md).\n","duration_seconds":32.153535,"num_turns":1,"usage":{"input_tokens":11438,"output_tokens":3464,"thinking_tokens":0,"cache_read_tokens":74176,"total_tokens":14902}}}
